    "BrochureContent": [
      {
        "ContentType": "Description",
        "SortOrder": 0,
        "Content": "Sligo Estates are pleased to bring to the market this well maintained 3 Bedroom semi-detached residence. The property is located in good residential area, close to Collooney town centre & only 10 minute drive Sligo city.  It is extremely convenient to all family amenities close to Primary Schools, Shops, Playground, GAA pitch etc. The property is in excellent decorative order throughout with oil fired central heating, double glazing, 1 en-suite, brick paving to front, Large back Garden with garden shed."
      },
      {
        "ContentType": "Accommodation",
        "SortOrder": 1,
        "Content": "Entrance Hall:\t    \r\n\r\n1.975m x 5.69m, Laminate floor, radiator, broadband, 2 p.p.\r\n\r\n\r\nLivingroom:    \t\r\n\r\n2.95m x 4.77m, Open fireplace, laminate floor, radiator, 6 p.p. t.v. point. \r\n              \r\n\r\nKitchen/Diningroom: \r\n\r\n3.6m x 5.0m, Fully fitted kitchen units, fitted hob & oven, tiled under cupboards, 8 p.p. Oil timer, radiator.\r\n\r\nW.C.:   1.3m x 1.65m, W.C., Wash hand basin.\r\n\r\n\r\nFirst Floor:\r\n\r\n\r\nLanding:\t    \r\n \r\n1.97m x 2.9m, Pitch pine floor, Hot press with insulated tank, Stira Ladder to attic with ample storage, 2 p.p.\r\n\r\n\r\nBedroom 1:      \t     \r\n\r\n2.5m x 2.5m, Radiator, 4 p.p. \r\n\r\n\r\nBedroom 2:\t\r\n\r\n3.3m x 2.5m, Radiator, 4 p.p.\r\n\r\n\r\nBedroom 3:\t      \r\n\r\n4.0m x 2.9m, Radiator, 6 p.p. telephone point, t.v. point.\r\nEn-Suite:\t      \r\n2.29m x 0.9m,   W.C.  Wash hand basin, Mira elite shower, tiled Floor & around the shower.\r\n\r\nBathroom:\t      \r\n\r\n2.15m x 1.74m,   W.C. Wash hand basin, bath, fully tiled, mirror, Radiator.\r\n\r\n\r\nServices: \t\t      \r\nAll mains, Oil Fired Central Heating, double glazing.  \r\n\t\t\t      \r\nBER Rating C.\r\n\r\nOutside:  \t     \r\n\r\nGarden shed, Brick paving to front & Patio and Large corner Garden to the rear, Outside Water Tap, mature shrubs & Flowers.\r\n\r\nViewing:    \t\t     \r\n\r\nStrictly by Appointment with Sligo Estates. \r\n\r\nAUCTIONEER HANDLING SALE:\r\nContact: \r\nGreg Kelly MSCSI, Assoc. RICS \r\nFrances Kelly I.P.A.V. \r\nTelephone: (071) 914 3425 / 0876242470"
      },
      {
        "ContentType": "Features",
        "SortOrder": 3,
        "Content": "uPVC Windows and Doors\r\nOil Fired CH and Solid fuel fire\r\nSafe Village location on daily frequent Bus and Train route to Sligo City\r\nSolid Pitch Pine Flooring up-stairs\r\nLarge corner side and rear Garden"
      },
